            <ArticleTitle>[Nitroglycerin-like action of the nitro ethers of sodium carboxymethylcellulose in an experiment].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>55-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>It has been demonstrated in acute experiments on animals of different species that nitroesters of sodium carboxymethylcellulose have the pharmacological properties exhibited by nitroglycerin. Unlike the latter one, they exert a mild hypotensive action.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
